      "body": "> v0.30.1 is the next minor release.\n>\n> **Timetable**: to be announced.\n\n## 👉 Changelog\n\n[compare changes](https://github.com/agntn/puzzles/compare/v0.30.0...v0.30.1)\n\n### 🚀 Enhancements\n\n- **collections:** add 9vw04 (#537)\n- **rushwallet:** solve wallet 26 (#536)\n- **collections:** add weave riddles (#535)\n- **tools:** add ChatGPT @ mentions (#533)\n- **tools:** fold long stage lists (#532)\n- **collections:** add zden/demobit-2018 thread (#525)\n- **collections:** add zden/level-xm17 thread (#524)\n\n### 🩹 Fixes\n\n- **collections:** fund bits/1 in 2015 (#538)\n\n### 💅 Refactors\n\n- write coin amounts in one spot (#531)\n- move prize sums out of format (#530)\n- lift extensions out (#527)\n- rename core/utils to format (#526)\n\n### 🏡 Chore\n\n- **docs:** move to Nuxt 4.6 (#534)\n\n### 🤖 CI\n\n- release through uppt (#528)\n\n### ❤️ Contributors\n\n- aeitwoen (@aeitwoen)\n- Ori (@oritwoen)",
